SUMMARY:The 33rd Annual Lotus World Music & Arts Festival
DESCRIPTION:Discover the music of exceptional performing artists and musicians from around the globe.\nPeople of every age\, ethnicity\, ability\, and background come to Lotus Festival each fall to be transformed by music and connect to the world around them. \nView the Schedule\nExplore the Festival Site Map\nBuy Tickets \n  \nFestival Lineup
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/the-33rd-annual-lotus-world-music-arts-festival/
CATEGORIES:Lotus Festival
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.lotusfest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-logo.jpg
END:VEVENT
