SUMMARY:Flash Mob Dance Workshop with Windfall Dancers
DESCRIPTION:The Lotus Festival Parade is back and we have a special surprise! \nWindfall Dancers will lead a community dance workshop to prepare participants for a Parade Dance Mob which will be led by the amazing artist group Fugu Dugu\, who play wild east punk. \nLearn some dance movements that complement their music!
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/flash-mob-dance-workshop-with-windfall-dancers/
LOCATION:Arts Village\, Arts Village (Between College Ave and Walnut)
CATEGORIES:Lotus Festival
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://www.lotusfest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/letsdancetogether.webp
END:VEVENT
