SUMMARY:Arts Camp
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, October 3\n12:00 PM – 4:00 PM\nThe annual Lotus Arts Camp is back..this time on the Square! Join us on Saturday\, October 3\, 2026\, from 12:00 PM – 4:00 PM for an afternoon of free\, family-friendly crafts\, activities\, and community fun in the heart of downtown. \nFamilies are invited to explore hands-on activities\, connect with local organizations\, and celebrate creativity together. Admission is free and all are welcome. \nInterested in partnering with the Arts Camp?\nCommunity partners are invited to host a hands-on craft\, activity\, or interactive experience for kids and families. Or contact our production manager – Chaz Mottinger at productionmanager@lotusfest.org.
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/arts-camp/
CATEGORIES:Free Event,Lotus Event,Arts Activity
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://www.lotusfest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Site-Event-Images.webp
END:VEVENT
