SUMMARY:Community Art Club
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun\, welcoming space to make art\, get creative\, and connect with others? Community Art Club is a free\, drop-in art space led by Lotus Teen Engagement Lead Noga Gordon. \nEach week\, participants can explore different crafts\, creative projects\, and hands-on activities in a relaxed environment. All ages and experience levels are welcome\, whether you love making art or just want to try something new. \nThursdays | 5–6 PM\nLotus Education & Arts Foundation\n105 S. Rogers St.\, Bloomington\, IN\nFree • Drop-ins welcome\nParking is available in the Regions Bank lot. \nCome create\, connect\, and share your ideas!
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/community-art-club-5/
LOCATION:105 S. Rogers Street
CATEGORIES:Arts Activity
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://www.lotusfest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Site-Event-Images-2.webp
